  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Light Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A bouncy, jelly-like formula for lip and cheek that feels lightweight and nourishing with a wash of juicy color.<b><br><br>Formulation Type: </b>Lip Balm & Treatment <br><br><b>Benefits: </b>Hydrating, Long-wearing, Plumping<br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Vitamin E, Hyaluronic Acid, and Castor Oil: Known to enhance nourishing feel while ensuring smooth and comfortable wear.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, and triclosan.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Gently swirl product with finger or lip brush and tap and blend into lips and cheeks. <br>-Bouncy, jelly-like formula retains shape and returns to a smooth texture with gentle use. <br>-Mario&rsquo;s Lip Lift&trade; technique featuring Jelly Jar&trade;: <br>-STEP ONE: ENHANCE Slightly overline outside the upper lip line with Ultra Suede&reg; Sculpting Lip Pencil (sold separately), focusing on the Cupid's bow. <br>-STEP TWO: LIFT Slightly overline the center of the bottom lip line, then extend the liner upwards to the outer corners moving the liner inside the lip line. <br>-STEP THREE: FILL Softly diffuse and blend the lip pencil from the corners inward and finish with your favorite shade of Jelly Jar&trade; Lip and Cheek Balm.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Vitamin E, Hyaluronic Acid, and Castor Oil: Known to enhance nourishing feel while ensuring smooth and comfortable wear.<br><br>Mauve Latte<br>Octyldodecanol, Hydrogenated Polyisobutene, Bis-Behenyl/Isostearyl/Phytosteryl Dimer Dilinoleyl Dimer Dilinoleate, Ethylcellulose, Microcrystalline Wax, Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Phenoxyethanol, Fragrance, Sorbitan Olivate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Caproic Acid, Tocopherol May Contain: Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492, Ci 77499), Red 7 (Ci 15850), Red 28 Lake (Ci 45410), Yellow 5 Lake (Ci 19140), Blue 1 Lake (Ci 42090).</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Light Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A bouncy, jelly-like formula for lip and cheek that feels lightweight and nourishing with a wash of juicy color.<b><br><br>Formulation Type: </b>Lip Balm & Treatment <br><br><b>Benefits: </b>Hydrating, Long-wearing, Plumping<br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Vitamin E, Hyaluronic Acid, and Castor Oil: Known to enhance nourishing feel while ensuring smooth and comfortable wear.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, and triclosan.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Gently swirl product with finger or lip brush and tap and blend into lips and cheeks. <br>-Bouncy, jelly-like formula retains shape and returns to a smooth texture with gentle use. <br>-Mario&rsquo;s Lip Lift&trade; technique featuring Jelly Jar&trade;: <br>-STEP ONE: ENHANCE Slightly overline outside the upper lip line with Ultra Suede&reg; Sculpting Lip Pencil (sold separately), focusing on the Cupid's bow. <br>-STEP TWO: LIFT Slightly overline the center of the bottom lip line, then extend the liner upwards to the outer corners moving the liner inside the lip line. <br>-STEP THREE: FILL Softly diffuse and blend the lip pencil from the corners inward and finish with your favorite shade of Jelly Jar&trade; Lip and Cheek Balm.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Vitamin E, Hyaluronic Acid, and Castor Oil: Known to enhance nourishing feel while ensuring smooth and comfortable wear.<br><br>Mauve Latte<br>Octyldodecanol, Hydrogenated Polyisobutene, Bis-Behenyl/Isostearyl/Phytosteryl Dimer Dilinoleyl Dimer Dilinoleate, Ethylcellulose, Microcrystalline Wax, Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Phenoxyethanol, Fragrance, Sorbitan Olivate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Caproic Acid, Tocopherol May Contain: Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492, Ci 77499), Red 7 (Ci 15850), Red 28 Lake (Ci 45410), Yellow 5 Lake (Ci 19140), Blue 1 Lake (Ci 42090).</div></details>",
